{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/registrationRecord","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registrationRecord","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment\/registrationrecord"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK26ManagementOpaqueEnrollmentV18registrationRecordSSvp","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registrationRecord","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"title":"registrationRecord"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Lowercase-hex serialized RFC 9807 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RegistrationRecord"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment":{"kind":"symbol","title":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The client-supplied half of an OPAQUE enrolment, as it appears inside registration \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change-password \/ reset-completion \/ bootstrap request bodies. There is no standalone"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register\/finish"},{"type":"text","text":" endpoint, deliberately. A record can only be created at a moment when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plaintext password legitimately exists on the client, and every one of those moments is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already an endpoint that takes a password. A free-standing finish would be an endpoint whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only job is to attach a credential to an account, which is a thing worth not having. Kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separate from ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CreateOpaqueCredential"},{"type":"text","text":"] because the tenant, the user and the credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier are all decided by the server — a client that could name them could enrol a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record against somebody else’s account."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment/registrationRecord":{"kind":"symbol","title":"registrationRecord","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registrationRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementO